<title>USA: Shikellamy Sch Dist, Pa., won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Shikellamy Sch Dist, Pa., won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp said it won $4.995 million of Shikellamy School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series of 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.11 percent.</p>
</text>
